sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator<br/>(opendatahub-operator /<br/>rhods-operator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModuleOp as feast-module-operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant FeastOp as feast-operator<br/>(upstream, managed)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over PlatformOp,FeastOp: Flow 1: FeastOperator CR Reconciliation

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create/Update FeastOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: Watch event (FeastOperator CR)
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read ConfigMap<br/>(odh-feastoperator-config)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: ConfigMap data<br/>(platformVersion, platform-name)

    Note over ModuleOp: Action chain:<br/>initialize → upgradeIfNeeded →<br/>setKustomizedParams → releases →<br/>reconcilePlatformVersion →<br/>kustomize.Render →<br/>migrateDeploymentSelector →<br/>deploy → deployments.Status → gc

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Apply kustomize manifests<br/>(Deployment, CRDs, RBAC, ServiceMonitor)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>FeastOp: feast-operator Deployment created/updated

    Note over PlatformOp,FeastOp: Flow 2: Platform Version Handshake

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Write platformVersion to ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Read ConfigMap (platformVersion key)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>ModuleOp: platformVersion value

    Note over ModuleOp: Compare versions,<br/>run upgrade logic if needed

    ModuleOp->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator status<br/>(releases[name=platform])<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over PlatformOp,FeastOp: Flow 3: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>ModuleOp: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    ModuleOp-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
